00:00:03.837 --> 00:00:08.842 size:53% position:73% line:53%
Gamache.

00:00:06.840 --> 00:00:09.509 size:53% position:73% line:53%
Privé des touristes étrangers,

00:00:07.708 --> 00:00:09.509 size:53% position:73% line:53%
les visiteurs se font rare

00:00:09.142 --> 00:00:09.509 size:53% position:73% line:53%
Privé des touristes étrangers,

00:00:11.478 --> 00:00:13.814 size:53% position:73% line:53%
- Le château Frontenac est

00:00:12.345 --> 00:00:14.681 size:53% position:73% line:53%
l'hôtel le plus photographié du

00:00:13.213 --> 00:00:15.549 size:53% position:73% line:53%
