00:00:17.617 --> 00:00:20.754 size:53% position:73% line:53%
Privé des touristes étrangers,

00:00:18.618 --> 00:00:21.955 size:53% position:73% line:53%
les visiteurs se font rare

00:00:19.820 --> 00:00:23.190 size:53% position:73% line:53%
dans le Vieux-Québec.

00:00:21.054 --> 00:00:24.691 size:53% position:73% line:53%
La capitale a entregistré

00:00:22.255 --> 00:00:26.226 size:53% position:73% line:53%
une baisse d'achalandage

00:00:23.490 --> 00:00:27.728 size:53% position:73% line:53%
